---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About SEEN IN KOREA"
  description="SEEN IN KOREA is an independent English-language media platform covering Korean culture, consumer trends, products and everyday life."
>
  <main>
    <section class="listing-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">KOREA, VERIFIED.</div>
        <h1>ABOUT SEEN IN KOREA</h1>
        <p>
          SEEN IN KOREA is an independent English-language media platform covering Korean culture,
          consumer trends, products and everyday life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="article-wrap article-body">
        <h2>What we cover</h2>
        <p>
          We report on K-culture and entertainment, K-beauty and Korean products, life in Korea,
          foreign resident and visitor experiences, and Korean consumer and retail trends.
        </p>

        <h2>How we report</h2>
        <p>
          We distinguish verified facts, official campaigns, reported claims and unconfirmed information.
          We prioritize primary sources, official statements, original interviews and on-the-ground information
          whenever possible.
        </p>

        <h2>Editorial and commercial separation</h2>
        <p>
          Reporting and commerce are handled separately. Advertising, affiliate relationships and commercial
          partnerships are disclosed and do not determine editorial conclusions.
        </p>

        <h2>Corrections and updates</h2>
        <p>
          When material facts change or an error is identified, we update the relevant story and correct the record
          as appropriate.
        </p>

        <h2>Publisher</h2>
        <p>
          SEEN IN KOREA is operated by Won Global in South Korea.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Editorial inquiries, corrections, interview requests and business or partnership inquiries:
          <a href="mailto:seeninkorea@gmail.com">seeninkorea@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
